# Start here

If Microsoft 365 or sign-in is down, this handbook still works. Everything below is on your device.

:::callout{type=warning}
Crisis updates arrive as text messages from Emaileri, not Teams. Keep your phone with you and on.
:::

## What to do now

1. Stay where you are and check this page first.
2. Don't try workarounds with personal accounts or apps.
3. If you can't work, tell your manager by phone.
4. For anything urgent about IT, call :contact[it-helpdesk].
5. If you suspect a security incident, call :contact[security-desk] straight away.

## When things are back

Your apps will start working again on their own. The handbook updates itself the next time you open it.

See also [Contact the helpdesk](../helpdesk/contact-helpdesk.en.md).
